    "summary": "A signed-in dashboard home with live KPI cards driven by a 24h/7d/30d range toggle, a filterable activity feed, and a dismissable action rail — with real loading, error, and caught-up states reachable by interaction.",
    "sourcePath": "apps/componentLibrary/src/pageRecipes/DashboardHomePage.tsx",
