        "label": "Metrics endpoint",
        "note": "Add a GET /api/metrics?range= route handler that queries the D1 'vybekiit' orders table (the one the shipped app/api/webhook/route.ts writes) and returns { revenueCents, newCustomers, activeUsers, churnRisk, deltaPct }; call it from runRefresh in place of METRICS_BY_RANGE.",
