    "title": "User settings page",
    "summary": "A populated account settings page — profile form with a live avatar and bio counter, theme and notification preferences on real switches, and a dirty-state save bar with a reachable email-validation error and a saving → saved sequence.",
    "sourcePath": "apps/componentLibrary/src/pageRecipes/UserSettingsPage.tsx",
